call Chars.ActSound $char $act 85 mecanismo-dtritus6 0.023 +4
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 87 mecanismo-dtritus1 0.03 +4
class
	FallSound caida-dtritus
	FallSoundVol 0.05
let talk Talk
do TalkSnd
let talk TalkNPC
do TalkSnd
let talk Talk0
do Talk0Snd
let talk TalkNPC0
do Talk0Snd
let talk Talk1
do Talk1Snd
let talk TalkNPC1
do Talk1Snd
let talk Talk2
do Talk2Snd
let talk TalkNPC2
do Talk2Snd
let talk Talk3
do Talk3Snd
let talk TalkNPC3
do Talk3Snd
let talk Talk4
do Talk4Snd
let talk TalkNPC4
do Talk4Snd
let talk Talk5
do Talk5Snd
let talk TalkNPC5
do Talk5Snd

section TalkSnd

section Talk0Snd
call Chars.ActSound $char $talk 2 mecanismo-dtritus5 0.022
call Chars.ActSound $char $talk 3 mecanismo-dtritus6 0.022
